Hero reframed: Grimaldi Engineering is migrating the trades from manual
craft to automated systems. New registry-driven Forge Line section — one
automation product per trade: Palletizer OS (shipped, live optimizer),
FloorForge AI, PaintForge AI, DryForge AI (in development, code public) —
plus the ForgeOS note behind the line. ItemList JSON-LD so search engines
and AI agents read the product line as structured data. Four locales.
